# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Nothing derived from the game goes into git. Everything below is made on each machine from the
# user's own dump by tools/setup.py (or the installer), or downloaded from its official source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The game and data derived from it: default.xex, image.bin, symbols, extracted assets, subtitles,
# the HD AI Remaster pack, decompiled scripts...
/private/
# C++ generated by XenonRecomp from default.xex (the recompiled game code)
/generated/
# Game shaders translated to DXBC by the runtime
/tests/shadercache/
**/shadercache/
**/shaderdump/
**/texture_dump/
# Game screenshots (a few chosen ones live in docs/screenshots/)
/docs/capturas/
# Subtitle texts (transcribed from the game's voices): release asset "legendas", not git
/languages/*/subtitles.txt

# Builds and the play folder
/build/
/dist/
**/build/
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.pdb
*.map
*.obj

# XenonRecomp: cloned at a pinned commit by tools/setup.py, plus patches/XenonRecomp.patch
/tools/XenonRecomp/

# Third-party binaries and SDK files: downloaded by tools/setup.py (see each README.md)
/thirdparty/ffmpeg/bin/
/thirdparty/ffmpeg/include/
/thirdparty/dlss/bin/
/thirdparty/dlss/lib/
/thirdparty/dlss/include/
/thirdparty/fsr/bin/
/thirdparty/fsr/Kits/

# Machine-specific settings of the tools (tools/buildenv.py)
/config/local.toml
/setup.log
/userdata/
/CrashSetup.exe

# Python / editors
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user

# Local AI assistant files (kept on each machine, not published)
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# Safety net: never commit a game dump, wherever it is copied
*.xex
*.rcf
*.bik
*.rsd
*.p3d
image.bin
**/game/

# Release assets (tools/make_release.py)
/release/
*.log
